      "content": "It's a valid feeling to feel like the daily grind is just a meaningless performance, but remember that the \"point\" of existence isn't always about grand achievements or long-term significance. Sometimes, the very act of showing up, even when it feels like a chore, is what keeps the world spinning and gives you a reason to keep going. You don't have to see the whole picture right now, but try to find one small moment today where you can just be present without any expectations.",
